@startuml
' Figure B: The end-to-end reflect -> spread -> locate -> accept -> fire pipeline
' for one base rewrite  Swap(A,B) ~> Pair(B,A).  Swimlanes are the pipeline stages;
' the host report is consulted ONLY to gate (which rules fired), never for sigma.
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #7A7A7A
  FontColor #202020
  DiamondBorderColor #7A7A7A
}

title Reflect → Spread → Locate → Accept → Fire  (base rewrite: Swap(A,B) ~> Pair(B,A))

|#F2F2F2|Host / Dovetail|
start
:complete Dovetail report
(consulted ONLY to GATE:
which rules fired — never for σ);
note right #FCE8D6
  in_rho_match_gate_reject:
  fail closed BEFORE any Rho
  reduction if a fired rule is
  not matchable in Rho.
end note

|#E8F0FE|Reflect|
:downcast term → SwapDemoTerm;
:reflect_category_fn walks the runtime term
Swap(A,B) → GroundTerm  (bare head tags);
note right #E8F0FE
  Total-or-reject. NO
  report.rewrite_justifications
  (host σ) is read here.
end note

|#E8F0FE|Spread ⟦t⟧|
:spread_term_par at root nonce ρ —
  loc:ρ!(Swap̲)  │  loc:ρ/Swap.0!(Ā)  │  loc:ρ/Swap.1!(B̲)
  │  col:/cap: bottom-up collapse fold;

|#D7ECFB|Locate-all|
:collect_redex_sites walks the GroundTerm (pre-order DFS);
if (node head ∈ rule LHS roots?) then (yes)
  :record site ⌜(ρ,ℓ)⌝;
else (no)
  :skip (inert position);
endif
:co-install one automaton network per site
over the ONE spread (disjoint-prefix channels);

|#C9E7D4|sa: automaton|
:for(h ⟸ loc:ρ){ match h }  — the τ symbol inspection;
:Match  Swap̲  ⇒  descend to the Var leaves;
:read cap:ρ/Swap.0, cap:ρ/Swap.1  →  bind σ = [⟦A⟧, ⟦B⟧]
(the FULLY COLLAPSED subterms — O1: each symbol once);
:accept  →  send  sa:tc(K)!(σ₀, σ₁, @OUT);

|#F7D9D5|σ-receiver (firing)|
:persistent sigma_receiver_par consumes sa:tc(K);
:one atomic c(ℓ) COMM emits ⟦R⟧σ = ⟦Pair(B,A)⟧;

|#FEF7E0|@OUT|
:observe  Pair(B,A)  on @OUT
(≠ Swap(A,B): non-vacuous evidence the match ran IN RHO);
stop
@enduml
